  "description": "Take everything you thought you knew about gravel riding and think again. The all-new, aero inspired Fuji Jari Carbon is redefining the all purpose, do-it-all ride. Cargo was a key design consideration behind the Jari Carbon so we created the SnackBar, a unique top tube solution to hold your nutrition. Additionally, below the bottom bracket is the Stowaway box. This is our proprietary undercarriage storage system that is perfect for carrying everday ride essentials. Lastly we designed the frame with an elongated bottom bracket area to better accomodate large frame bags by allowing the waterbottles to sit lower on the seattube and downtube inside the main triangle of the frame.\nThe result is a bike that thrives on mixed surface rides, smooth roads, chipped tarmac, chunky gravel, dirt roads or even singletrack. Load it up for bikepacking or throw some road tires on for a fast tempo group ride. Whatever you throw at it all roads are open for the Jari Carbon.",
